# Secrets + runtime state stay local to the deployed NAS; never commit them.
.env
events/*.jsonl
state/ARMED
state/WAKE_SUMMON
state/RESUME_ARMED
state/orchestrator.lock/
state/resume.lock/
state/spend-*.txt
state/calls-*.txt
state/handoffs/
state/approved-queue.json

# NOTE: state/KILL_SWITCH is intentionally TRACKED -- it ships engaged.
# NOTE: resume/example.approved-queue.json IS tracked (the template); the live
#       state/approved-queue.json (real task text) stays local to the NAS.
